{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Almost I was</b> — like 'I was' from those who meet, almost that there would yet come a little of the troubles." "<b>I was</b> — in place of אהיה. Another interpretation: almost I would hope and the evil inclination would pass — I did not do so, but I was in all evil."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:05.832092092Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}